"Hides only this client's quota card, here and on its own tab; the tab and its cost and token numbers stay. Useful for an account with no quota to show, such as Claude Console. Grayed out when the tab itself is hidden below, because a hidden tab hides its quota card too." = "只隐藏这个客户端的额度卡片（此处和它自己的标签页）；标签页本身和费用、token 数字都会保留。适合没有额度可显示的账户，例如 Claude Console。如果下方已经隐藏整个标签页，此项会变灰，因为隐藏标签页会连同额度卡片一起隐藏。";
"Off removes the view from the tab row in the popover. Cost and token numbers are not affected." = "关闭后，该视图会从弹出窗口的标签栏移除。费用和 token 数字不受影响。";
"Drag to reorder; the order applies to both the top tabs and the quota cards. You can also drag a tab in the top bar. The switch shows or hides a client's tab, and hiding it also hides its quota card." = "拖动可调整顺序，顶部标签页和额度卡片都会按此顺序排列。也可以直接在顶部标签栏拖动。开关用于显示或隐藏客户端的标签页，隐藏时其额度卡片也会一起隐藏。";
"The switch shows or hides a client's tab, and hiding it also hides its quota card. Clients that only report quota, with no usage logs on this Mac (such as Antigravity), have no tab; they are listed here so you can place their quota card. The order applies to both tabs and quota cards." = "开关用于显示或隐藏客户端的标签页，隐藏时其额度卡片也会一起隐藏。只报告额度、这台 Mac 上没有用量记录的客户端（例如 Antigravity）没有标签页，列在这里是为了调整其额度卡片的位置。顺序同时应用于标签页和额度卡片。";
"Only affects the live session card. On: one row per agent and model. Off: one row per app." = "只影响实时会话卡片。开启：每个 agent 和模型各占一行。关闭：每个应用一行。";
"You can also drag the handle at the bottom edge of the popover. The width is fixed; Auto uses about 60% of your screen height." = "也可以拖动弹出窗口底部的控制柄。宽度固定；“自动”约为屏幕高度的 60%。";
"How often the menu bar re-reads your agents' logs. The dashboard updates whenever you open the popover, and the live tokens-per-minute figure updates every few seconds either way." = "菜单栏多久重新读取一次 agent 的日志。每次打开弹出窗口时仪表盘都会更新；实时每分钟 token 数不受此设置影响，每几秒更新一次。";
"Syrtis started as a fork of tokcat by handlecusion. Log parsing and pricing come from tokscale by Junho Yeo; the menu bar design draws on CodexBar by Peter Steinberger; the running cat comes from RunCat by Takuto Nakamura. MIT licensed." = "Syrtis 最初是从 handlecusion 的 tokcat 分支出来的。日志解析和计价来自 Junho Yeo 的 tokscale；菜单栏设计参考 Peter Steinberger 的 CodexBar；奔跑的猫来自 Takuto Nakamura 的 RunCat。采用 MIT 授权。";
"For a second Claude account, run Claude Code with CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR set to a separate folder, then add that folder here. Its usage is added to the same totals everywhere in Syrtis; there is no per-account view." = "要添加第二个 Claude 账户，请将 CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR 指向另一个目录来运行 Claude Code，再把该目录添加到这里。它的用量会并入 Syrtis 各处的同一份总计，不会按账户分别显示。";
"%lld of %lld folder(s) can't be read right now. Syrtis will try again on the next scan." = "%2$lld 个目录中有 %1$lld 个目前无法读取，Syrtis 下次扫描时会再试。";
"%lld path(s) can't be used as a scan folder, so they weren't added." = "有 %lld 条路径不能用作扫描目录，所以没有添加。";

