"The menu-bar animation follows your live token rate. Pick the range that fits how you work; you can change it later in Settings." = "菜单栏动画会跟着实时的 token 速率变化。选一个符合你使用习惯的范围，之后可以在“设置”里修改。";
"Light pace" = "轻度";
"Moderate pace" = "中度";
"Heavy pace" = "重度";
"Most people: Moderate" = "大多数人适合“中度”";
"The cat and parrot speed up and the sand gets busier as the live token rate climbs. The pace sets how much traffic reaches the top: Light at 600K tokens/min, Moderate at 3M, Heavy at 10M." = "实时 token 速率越高，猫和鹦鹉跑得越快、流沙也越热闹。动画速度决定多大的流量会到顶：轻度是每分钟 60 万 token、中度 300 万、重度 1,000 万。";
"A few agents at once, or a plan like Claude Max 5x" = "几个 agent 同时跑，或像 Claude Max 5x 这类方案";
"Lots of agents at once, such as Claude Code's ultracode, or a plan like Claude Max 20x" = "超多 agent 同时跑（例如 Claude Code 的 ultracode），或像 Claude Max 20x 这类方案";
"Set up Syrtis" = "设置 Syrtis";
"%lld left · everything here is also in Settings" = "还有 %lld 项・这里的每一项都能在“设置”里改";
"Skip setup" = "跳过设置";
"Agents on this Mac" = "这台 Mac 上的 agent";
"Syrtis found these agents on this Mac. Choose which ones get a tab, or keep them all." = "Syrtis 在这台 Mac 上找到了这些 agent。选择哪些要有标签页，或全部保留。";
"No agents found yet. A tab appears once an agent writes its logs or reports a limit." = "还没有找到任何 agent。agent 写入日志或报告额度后，就会出现标签页。";
"Choose tabs…" = "选择标签页…";
"Looks good" = "这样就好";
"Menu-bar icon" = "菜单栏图标";
"Animated icons follow your token rate; gauges drain as a quota window empties." = "会动的图标跟着 token 速率变化；量表会随额度时间窗用掉而减少。";
"Menu-bar text" = "菜单栏文字";
"What shows next to the icon." = "图标旁边要显示什么。";
"Start at login" = "登录时启动";
"Open Syrtis when you log in to your Mac, so your usage is always in the menu bar." = "登录 Mac 后自动打开 Syrtis，菜单栏随时看得到用量。";
"Syrtis already starts at login." = "Syrtis 已经会在登录时启动。";
"Your Discord profile can show today's usage. It is off unless you turn it on, and Settings shows exactly what would appear." = "你的 Discord 个人资料可以显示今天的用量。没有开启就不会显示，“设置”里会列出确切会出现的内容。";
"Set up in Settings…" = "到“设置”设置…";
"Done" = "完成";
"Discord is showing your usage. Settings has what appears and how to stop it." = "Discord 已在显示你的用量。要查看显示哪些内容、或如何关闭，请前往设置。";
"macOS did not add Syrtis to your login items. Check System Settings → General → Login Items." = "macOS 没有把 Syrtis 添加到登录项。请前往“系统设置 → 通用 → 登录项”查看。";
